\'3fnh ch\u7913\'3fc n\'e3ng, nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f, quy\u7873\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn v\'e0 t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc b\u7897\'3f m\'e1y, quan h\u7879\'3f c\'f4ng t\'e1c v\'e0 l\u7873\'3f l\u7889\'3fi l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa U\u7927\'3f ban Nh
\'e2n d\'e2n huy\u7879\'3fn v\'e0 c\'e1c c\'f5 quan chuy\'ean m\'f4n thu\u7897\'3fc U\u7927\'3f ban Nh\'e2n d\'e2n huy\u7879\'3fn,
\par Li\'ean B\u7897\'3f t\'e0i ch\'ednh  - U\u7927\'3f ban V\u7853\'3ft gi\'e1 Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc  qui \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0 h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn v\u7873\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f, t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc b\u7897\'3f m\'e1y, v\'e0 l
