\'fd t\'e0i ch\'ednh, gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f v\'e0 ng\'e2n s\'e1ch  huy\u7879\'3fn, ch\u7883\'3fu s\u7921\'3f l\'e3nh }{\f193\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483 \'f0\u7841\'3fo v\'e0 ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo to\'e0n di\u7879\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa U
\u7927\'3f ban Nh\'e2n d\'e2n huy\u7879\'3fn v\'e0 s\u7921\'3f ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo c\u7911\'3fa S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh v\'e0 U\u7927\'3f ban V\u7853\'3ft gi\'e1 t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd
\'f5ng.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483 Nhi\u7879\'3fm}{\f193\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483  v\u7909\'3f chung c\u7911\'3fa Ban T\'e0i ch\'ednh - Gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f huy\u7879\'3fn l\'e0 n\u7855\'3fm v\'e0 b\u7843\'3fo v\u7879\'3f c
\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi v\u7889\'3fn, c\'e1c ngu\u7891\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, g\'f3p ph\u7847\'3fn b\u7889\'3f tr\'ed v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f cao c\'e1c lo\u7841
\'3fi v\u7889\'3fn v\'e0 c\'e1c ngu\u7891\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa huy\u7879\'3fn; g\'f3p ph\u7847\'3fn qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\f185\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483 \'fd ch\u7863\'3ft ch\u7869\'3f m\u7885\'3fi s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3f
m do lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa qu\u7847\'3fn ch\'fang s\'e1ng t\u7841\'3fo ra, g\'f3p ph\u7847\'3fn th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn s\u7921\'3f ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm m\u7897\'3ft c\'e1ch h\u7907\'3fp l\'fd, c\'f3 k\u7871\'3f
