\par Th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f b\'e1o c\'e1o, th\u7881\'3fnh th\u7883\'3f, theo \'f0\u7883\'3fnh k\u7923\'3f v\'e0 kh\'f4ng \'f0\u7883\'3fnh k\u7923\'3f v\u7873\'3f c\'f4ng t\'e1c qu\u7843\'3fn l}{
