\u7899\'3fc, t}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483 \'ecnh h\'ecnh gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f th\u7883\'3f tr}{\f193\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483 \'fd\u7901\'3fng trong huy\u7879\'3fn v\u7899\'3fi U\u7927\'3f ban Nh\'e2n d\'e2n  huy
