\par }{\f193\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483 Ban T\'e0i ch\'ednh  - Gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f huy\u7879\'3fn ph\u7889\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c Ban chuy\'ean m\'f4n c\'f3 li\'ean quan c\u7911\'3fa huy\u7879\'3fn, gi\'fap \'f0\u7905\'3f, h\'fd
\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\'e1c ng\'e0nh, c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft, kinh doanh, x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng, ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f \'f0\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3fng, s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp kinh t\u7871\'3f \u7903\'3f huy
\u7879\'3fn l\u7853\'3fp v\'e0 t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch t\'e0i ch\'ednh  gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f, c\'f4ng t\'e1c h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n, b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7843\'3fm hi\u7879\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f kinh t\u7871
\'3f cao c\u7911\'3fa s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft- kinh doanh, t\'e0i ch\'ednh tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc U\u7927\'3f ban Nh\'e2n d\'e2n huy\u7879\'3fn.
\par C\'e1c c\'f5 quan h\'e0nh ch\'ednh v\'e0 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e3n x}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483 \'e3}{\f193\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483  \u7903\'3f huy\u7879\'3fn l\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng 
