m hi\u7879\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f v\u7873\'3f c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483  m\'ecnh ph\u7909\'3f tr\'e1ch, c\'e1c }{\f193\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483 \'f0\'f5n v\u7909\'3f d\u7921\'3f to
\'e1n c\u7845\'3fp I ph\u7843\'3fi l\u7853\'3fp k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch t\'e0i ch\'ednh c\u7911\'3fa ng\'e0nh m}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483 \'ecnh g\u7917\'3fi Ban T\'e0i ch\'ednh  - Gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f huy\u7879\'3fn xem x\'e9t tr
\'ecnh U\u7927\'3f ban Nh\'e2n d\'e2n hu\u7925\'3f\u7879\'3fn x\'e9t duy\u7879\'3ft. Ban T\'e0i ch\'ednh - Gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f huy\u7879\'3fn gi\'fap U\u7927\'3f ban Nh\'e2n d\'e2n huy\u7879\'3fn }{\f193\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483 \'f0i
