nh, th\'e0nh ph}{\f193\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10380755\charrsid6177483 \u7889\'3f v\'e0 U\u7927\'3f ban Nh\'e2n d\'e2n huy\u7879\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fn \'e1nh v\u7873\'3f cho li\'ean B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh  - U\u7927\'3f ban V\u7853\'3ft gi\'e1 Nh\'e0 n\'fd
